ared about the movie hopefully it'll  be somewhat well put together and  hopefully it'll be entertaining but i am  kind of worried now but let's just wait  and watch it to see what we think about  it in the meantime let me know what you  think about all of this exciting news in  the comments down below don't forget to  like the video and subscribe so you can  stay up to date on all things happening  with marvel for live updates you can  follow me on instagram and twitter and  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof  me

